id: SCA-021
title: GitHub Actions uses self-hosted runner
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: self-hosted
patterns:
  - regex: runs-on:.*self-hosted
    message: Self-hosted runners persist between jobs. A malicious PR can plant backdoors, modify PATH, or steal credentials that affect subsequent workflow runs.
fix: Use ephemeral self-hosted runners (e.g., actions-runner-controller with ephemeral mode). Never run untrusted PR workflows on self-hosted runners.
